Package: mtgcodex.api
Type: Package
Title: MTG Codex Toolkit
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Florian", "Ricquier", email = "florian.ricquier@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Toolkit for managing the MTG Codex collection and strategy pool.
    Provides data import helpers that append CSV purchases into the SQLite
    collection, fetches missing card records from Scryfall, exposes a Plumber
    service with rule-based synergy scoring plus deck suggestions, and ships
    matchup simulators for testing archetypes, all wrapped as a reusable R
    package.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
BugReports: https://gitlab.com/mtgcodex.api/mtgcodex.api_api/-/issues
URL: https://gitlab.com/mtgcodex.api/mtgcodex.api_api
LazyData: true
